{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/735866-the-pdf-is-out","id":735866,"title":"The pdf is out","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-28T14:40:21-07:00","id":735866,"title":"The pdf is out","content":"Well, the pdf is now out so its time to take a look at it.<br /> One thing I noticed right off the bat is that looking at text in layout with art around is quite a bit more inviting then the pre-edited text that was available through the kickstarter.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>How can I know if what I claim I know to be true is rejecting the idea that there is something I might not know? How can I know if what I claim I don't know to be true is rejecting the idea that there is something I do know?<br /> -Zhuangzi","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1715-ostarion","name":"Ostarion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1715_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"305"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T16:05:32-07:00","id":736105,"title":"","content":"Right off the bat, I still strongly object to the notion that a person starts out human and has their soul &quot;replaced&quot; by the monster. That's the biggest and most jarring change from the original, and I've never been comfortable with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6806-abattoirista","name":"Abattoirista","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T16:13:06-07:00","id":736119,"title":"","content":"Also, there's still no blanket rule for swarms. The Infestation power says you become a swarm, and can &quot;condense&quot; to inflict damage, but without referring to a rule for swarms or something like the Swarm tilt in Demon, it otherwise has no effect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6806-abattoirista","name":"Abattoirista","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T17:13:26-07:00","id":736324,"title":"","content":"Starting to read my copy now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I game. This is the way.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8-storyteller","name":"Storyteller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T18:34:07-07:00","id":736450,"title":"","content":"The art is really good. The book has some truly horrifying monsters in its pages, and the illustrations and layout fit the tone really well. Unfortunately various parts of the introduction are still a bit off from what the writing in the rest of the book has to say about being a Beast and the Devouring. I feel it's weighted down by misinforming ambiguity in how it summarizes those topics that is a relic of being the first part of the book to have undergone the rewrite and not being redone once the rest was actually finished.<br /> <br /> I quite like the more positive Family stereotypes, and the views from without are still awesome. The Tales Of The Dark Mother are fantastic and terrifying. The one with the mages and the one with the reversal on the unfortunate hero are my favorites.<br /> <br /> The write up of Tokyo Bay has... not been updated. Like, it still mentions Heroes being created by Beasts rather than drawn to them or alerted by their actions in the Primordial Dream and there are tiny detail founded on that that haven't been changed either.<br /> <br /> I think it's a bit of a shame the Move On sidebar and the Kissing Cousins topic were cut, even if the important part of the content of the former has survived in the Sex, Drugs and Other Difficult Issues sidebar. Which may be an altogether more appropriate way of talking about it.<br /> <br /> As for the changes to Heroes from the original draft: while I feel something was lost there, I've digested it properly and I am fully convinced that the rewrite is a healthier way to do their concept and provides a more balanced narrative from multiple perspectives. I caught some further little changes to Sleeping Beauty that make her more interesting. Also found, I think, other altered or added bits spread through the book that I liked.<br /> <br /> Overall, it's a great product with some minor rough edges, but I'm very much glad I put the money in for it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":188,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","user":"YeOfLittleFaith","date":". 10-28-2015, 10:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T18:58:52-07:00","id":736497,"title":"","content":"I'm loving the addition of Tales of the Dark Mother! They have given a couple of ideas that I may be able to run with!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T20:01:48-07:00","id":736619,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>YeOfLittleFaith</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/735866-the-pdf-is-out?p=736450#post736450\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The write up of Tokyo Bay has... not been updated. Like, it still mentions Heroes being created by Beasts rather than drawn to them or alerted by their actions in the Primordial Dream and there are tiny detail founded on that that haven't been changed either.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>You might want to put that in the errata thread, as it looks like Chapter Six is the pre-revision version.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-29T19:45:01-07:00","id":740661,"title":"","content":"i felt so sorry for ben <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />,i mean the was dating a hot vampire,that is the <i>dream.</i>,And then a Dean winchest knock off screwed him over <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Also,can we talk about how downright adorale patrick and ahmed are? i mean,they are underwater monster made of pure refined terror but also at he same time they are <i>relationship goals!</i>!<br /> And jesus,the Dark mother is not even in the general <i>vicinity </i>of fucking around","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 10-29-2015, 10:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T12:14:40-07:00","id":742461,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Abattoirista</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/735866-the-pdf-is-out?p=736105#post736105\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Right off the bat, I still strongly object to the notion that a person starts out human and has their soul &quot;replaced&quot; by the monster. That's the biggest and most jarring change from the original, and I've never been comfortable with it.</div> </div> </div> </div>While I agree and also strongly object to this, it's worth mentioning that in the World of Darkness, Our Souls are Different; in nWoD, the word 'soul', as near as I can tell, basically just means 'amorphous something something mystical something insert technobabble here.' It is completely separate from the mind except for when it isn't. And it is apparently totally interchangeable with all other souls. Have your soul ripped out and destroyed? Replace it with someone else's soul and you'll be fine. Mages need their souls to do magic, though, so there's that. And various other splats need their souls for something something insert more technobabble here.<br /> <br /> That said, it doesn't actually matter what 'soul' means in the World of Darkness. The average person reading the book is not going to have an exhaustive knowledge of the nWoD's cosmology and how souls fit into it (poorly, confusingly, and inconsistently). They're going to see something to the effect of, &quot;The Horror devours your soul and then replaces it,&quot; and they're probably going to take that to mean that a Beast is basically a Horror wearing a meat-suit that it can control and make do whatever it wants.<br /> <br /> I know it's not really supported in the nWoD cosmology, but in my games, Beasts that are made by other Beasts instead of experiencing the Homecoming are approached in Exalted terms: the Horror devours and replaces the <i>lower</i> soul. The <i>po - </i>the animal instincts, the lower self, the ID - is devoured. The <i>hun</i> - basically the ego and superego - is left intact and merges with the Horror to create the new Beast.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Hige sceal \u00fe\u0113 heardra, heorte \u00fe\u0113 c\u0113nre,<br /> m\u014dd sceal \u00fe\u0113 m\u0101re, \u00fe\u0113 \u016bre m\u00e6gen lytla\u00f0.</i>","edited":{"userid":8950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8950-vithrir","user":"Vithrir","date":". 10-30-2015, 03:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8950-vithrir","name":"Vithrir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8950_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T13:17:18-07:00","id":742653,"title":"","content":"I keep getting a vibe from the Devouring/Horror change that the Devouring is like a more ritualized, metaphorical version of the Homecoming anyway. The Homecoming was &quot;I turned and realized that I <i>was</i> the beast&quot;, the Devouring feels like, &quot;When I accepted that I was the beast, my soul changed into the form that it was meant to be, and dreamt that my new self devoured the old.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},