ecoming are approached in Exalted terms: the Horror devours and replaces the <i>lower</i> soul. The <i>po - </i>the animal instincts, the lower self, the ID - is devoured. The <i>hun</i> - basically the ego and superego - is left intact and merges with the Horror to create the new Beast.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am sooo stealing this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T21:04:13-07:00","id":743738,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BigDamnHero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/735866-the-pdf-is-out?p=742653#post742653\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I keep getting a vibe from the Devouring/Horror change that the Devouring is like a more ritualized, metaphorical version of the Homecoming anyway. The Homecoming was &quot;I turned and realized that I <i>was</i> the beast&quot;, the Devouring feels like, &quot;When I accepted that I was the beast, my soul changed into the form that it was meant to be, and dreamt that my new self devoured the old.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Actually, it's more like &quot;another Beast came to my house, told me I was supposed to also be a Beast, and he changed me into one&quot;. The self-actualization aspect is now largely banished to a sidebar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6806-abattoirista","name":"Abattoirista","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-31T06:02:09-07:00","id":744310,"title":"","content":"I take it there's no significant difference between the (updated) draft and this latest version?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-31T06:27:44-07:00","id":744323,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ChairKicker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/735866-the-pdf-is-out?p=744310#post744310\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I take it there's no significant difference between the (updated) draft and this latest version?</div> </div> </div> </div> I'm actually really curious about this more than anything.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"",